entries[116350] = { ["name"] = "Pattern: Riding Harness", ["text"] = "Binds when picked up\nUse: Teaches you how to make a Riding Harness.\nRequires Draenor Leatherworking (1)\nSell Price:\nRiding Harness\nBinds when picked up\nMount\n(Account-wide)\nUse: Teaches you how to summon a Dustmane Direwolf. This is a ground mount.\nSummons and dismisses your Dustmane Direwolf.\nRequires level 1 to 80 ( 80)\nRequires Draenor Leatherworking (100)\nRequires Apprentice Riding\n\n\"Cautious by direwolf standards, the dustmane can only be coaxed to ride with something it considers special.\"\nProfession:\nLeatherworking\nRequires Burnished Leather (100), Sorcerous Air (20)" }
